BaseConfigLib::setFieldMode
├── given empty config (all zeros)
│   ├── given setting ARBITER to STORAGE
│   │   └── it should set bits 0-1 to 01
│   ├── given setting RECIPIENT to CATCHALL
│   │   └── it should set bits 6-7 to 10
│   └── given setting RECIPIENT_IS_SPONSOR to SUBPOLICY
│       └── it should set bits 18-19 to 11
├── given existing config
│   ├── given overwriting existing mode
│   │   └── it should replace the old mode
│   └── given setting different field
│       └── it should preserve other fields
└── given setting mode to SKIP (0)
    └── it should clear the bits for that field